":"马超-关羽1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"关羽：此诺既成，磨枪相待便是。","hasText":true,"duration":3.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06973698BEE141000183137343731393133.mp3"},{"id":"06150698BEE131000183137363333363430","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"狄仁杰-关羽2","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"关羽：千年来，每当出海之人看到它，就能看到家的方向。","hasText":true,"duration":7.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06150698BEE131000183137363333363430.mp3"},{"id":"06238698BEE131000183930303031323437","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"云缨-关羽1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"关羽：（豪迈笑）哈哈哈，那我来与你过两招！","hasText":true,"duration":5.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06238698BEE131000183930303031323437.mp3"},{"id":"06586698BEE131000183130383832313337","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"貂蝉-关羽1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"关羽：最近寄往京华的家书愈发多了。","hasText":true,"duration":4.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06586698BEE131000183130383832313337.mp3"},{"id":"06485698BEE141000183134353432393630","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"马超-关羽2","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"关羽：外人所言致命毒瘴，在贤弟信中只道“寻常雾气”？","hasText":true,"duration":7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06485698BEE141000183134353432393630.mp3"},{"id":"06513698BEE121000183734353433303733","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"朵莉亚-关羽2","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"关羽：（大笑）等你和我一样高再说！","hasText":true,"duration":5.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06513698BEE121000183734353433303733.mp3"},{"id":"06283698BEE121000183138323439373932","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"朵莉亚-关羽1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"关羽：临行前，赶海人送了我些海螺。","hasText":true,"duration":3.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06283698BEE121000183138323439373932.mp3"},{"id":"06728698BEE111000183134373931303331"