35","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"IDLE","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"你们看这罗盘所指何方？","hasText":true,"duration":4.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06787698BEE0D1000183134313436333835.mp3"},{"id":"06120698BEE0D1000183734333639383135","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"回城","category":"回城","seq":null,"text":"天涯有信，四海同归","hasText":true,"duration":4.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06120698BEE0D1000183734333639383135.mp3"},{"id":"06550698BEE0A1000183338323038363734","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"移动喊话1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"策马横刀，威震狂涛！","hasText":true,"duration":3.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06550698BEE0A1000183338323038363734.mp3"},{"id":"06225698BEE0B1000183739313830353335","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"移动喊话5","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"船出港，海茫茫，风满千帆货满舱。","hasText":true,"duration":7.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06225698BEE0B1000183739313830353335.mp3"},{"id":"06582698BEE0C1000183133353832353239","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"移动喊话6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"吾刀所向，即是故乡！","hasText":true,"duration":4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06582698BEE0C1000183133353832353239.mp3"},{"id":"06717698BEE0B1000183137343432323739","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"移动喊话4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"天时难测，洪仞扬波，云雷骤合，人力可搏。","hasText":true,"duration":8.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06717698BEE0B1000183137343432323739.mp3"},{"id":"06188698BEE0B1000183138343332343839","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"移动喊话3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"（哈哈哈）收好这朵刺桐花，今后风浪再大，关某护你！","hasText":true,"duration":8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06188698BEE0B1000183138343332343839.mp3"},{"id":"06565698BEE0A1000183437373836363931","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"移动喊话2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"与尔先祖立言，此生誓佑闽海，风雨几度，千里相赴！","hasText":true,"duration":8.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06565698BEE0A1000183437373836363931.mp3"},{"id":"06797698BEE0C1000183134363231303236","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"移动喊话7","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"人寿百年，但逆流能争之辈代出，奋楫不辍。","hasText":true,"duration":7.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06797698BEE0C1000183134363231303236.mp3"},{"id":"06302698BEE0A1000183135373432343635","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"大厅喊话3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"刺桐花满三洲岸，百舸竞渡云海关。","hasText":true,"duration":20.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06302698BEE0A1000183135373432343635.mp3"},{"id":"06948698BEE091000183131373037313530","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"大厅喊话1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"神骥踏长风，丝路启千秋！","hasText":true,"duration":21.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06948698BEE091000183131373037313530.mp3"},{"id":"06544698BEE091000183131373833343930","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"大厅喊话2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"开远洋之道，诺千帆无忧！","hasText":true,"duration":21.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06544698BEE091000183131373833343930.mp3"},{"id":"06180698BEE0A1000183234353531373739","heroId":"222","skinId":"1700","skinName":"神骥·镇沧海","title":"泉水喊话","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"乘风起，驰万里","hasText":true,"duration":4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06180698BEE0A1000183234353531373739.mp3"},{"id":"06237697B1B911000183132313335313530","heroId":"222","skinId":"756","skinName":"一骑当千","title":"关羽_营地春节语音","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"决定了内心的正道，便绝无动摇","hasText":true,"duration":5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/222/06237697B1B911000183132313335313530.mp3"},{"id":"06099692952891